27:10.710 --> 27:10.758
places.

27:14.090 --> 27:16.110
So outline of possible projects,

27:16.811 --> 27:19.515
rehabilitation and preservation of housing.

27:20.738 --> 27:24.671
Homebuyer assistance. Support for affordable

27:25.171 --> 27:28.524
