and then housekeeping-wise, I need to announce that there's

03:04:04.003 --> 03:04:07.500
3 items that were noticed for public hearing as follows.

03:04:08.013 --> 03:04:11.286
However, these 3 items, only 15A will be

03:04:11.786 --> 03:04:15.457
held as a public hearing tonight. So, if you received a public hearing notice

03:04:15.794 --> 03:04:18.665
or something like that, we want you to really pay attention to this part.

03:04:19.146 --> 03:04:22.736
Um, 16A will not be a public hearing.

03:04:23.072 --> 03:04:28.937
That's the ordinance of Eagle Mountain City amending Eagle Mountain Municipal Code 8.15.0.0

03:04:29.437 --> 03:04:33.440
noise levels. And then 17A is also

03:04:33.940 --> 03:04:37.430
not a public hearing, approval of 2nd amendment to the Triumph Master

03:04:37.930 --> 03:04:41.869
Development Agreement for the Triumph subdivision. If you would like to comment on

03:04:41.917 --> 03:04:45.594
the 2 noticed items, 16A or 17A, You may

03:04:46.094 --> 03:04:48.418
do so during the public comment portion of the meeting.

03:04:49.473 --> 03:04:52.233
Yes, I know it's next. Thank you.

03:04:52.575 --> 03:04:55.936
And next, Councilmember Whiting will lead

03:04:56.001 --> 03:04:57.175
us in the Pledge of Allegiance.

03:05:00.566 --> 03:05:04.103
I pledge allegiance to the flag of the United States

03:05:04.603 --> 03:05:08.254
of America and to the republic for which it stands,

03:05:08.287 --> 03:05:12.343
one nation under God, indivisible, with liberty and justice for all. With liberty

03:05:12.425 --> 03:05:13.479
and justice for all.

03:05:18.660 --> 03:05:22.338
All right, um, thank you all for being here.

03:05:22.709 --> 03:05:26.855
Uh, we are going to go right to information items and upcoming events with Mr.

03:05:26.920 --> 03:05:29.683
Reeves to provide that information to us. Okay,

03:05:30.622 --> 03:05:34.652
uh, thank you, Mayor Pro Tem. Um, our city offices, um, and public library will

03:05:34.684 --> 03:05:37.956
be closed on Friday, uh, July 24th. 4th in observance

03:05:38.020 --> 03:05:42.113
of Pioneer Day. And because that Friday is closed,

03:05:42.322 --> 03:05:45.949
Thursday is kind of like our city's Friday.

03:05:46.575 --> 03:05:49.560
So it'll be a skeleton staff that will be here on that Thursday.

03:05:50.443 --> 03:05:53.604
We have fireworks that we're promoting at Utah Lake on

03:05:54.134 --> 03:05:57.874
July 24th at 10 PM. There's been donations

03:05:57.906 --> 03:06:00.570
made, and there's going to be a barge on both sides of the lake.

03:06:01.437 --> 03:06:04.822
For more information about the fireworks, That is at

03:06:05.528 --> 03:06:09.603
fireworksstate or fireworks at

03:06:10.103 --> 03:06:13.438
utahlake.com, and and also too,

03:06:14.336 --> 03:06:18.363
we are because of the dry conditions going to be

03:06:18.863 --> 03:06:22.807
working with the state of Utah on a ban of fireworks

03:06:23.320 --> 03:06:27.122
at your residential homes and and within the city limits.

03:06:27.186 --> 03:06:30.782
And so we encourage our community to go support. support this at Utah Lake.

03:06:31.600 --> 03:06:34.876
In addition to the celebration on the 24th,

03:06:34.972 --> 03:06:38.392
our city itself will be having a celebration on the 25th.

03:06:38.922 --> 03:06:42.358
It's called our Summer Bash. It's a laser show, and that'll be from 4 to

03:06:42.858 --> 03:06:47.320
10 PM at Cory B. Wright Park. So great events both on, on the 24th

03:06:47.400 --> 03:06:51.125
and the 25th. Our Back to School Night is Saturday, August 1st,

03:06:51.173 --> 03:06:55.333
from 6 to 8 PM at Cory B. Wright Memorial Park. And then

03:06:55.445 --> 03:06:59.462
we have a Truth in Taxation public hearing scheduled for August 6th

03:06:59.962 --> 03:07:03.447
at 6 PM, and we invite our public to attend. Thank you, Mr.

03:07:03.496 --> 03:07:07.593
Reeves. All right, now we've reached the public comment chunk of

03:07:08.093 --> 03:07:11.321
our agenda. Time has been set aside for the public to express their ideas,

03:07:11.417 --> 03:07:15.017
concerns, and comments. Please limit your comments to 3 minutes each.

03:07:16.158 --> 03:07:19.998
As a reminder, public comment is an opportunity for community members

03:07:20.320 --> 03:07:24.014
To address the city council, and each speaker is allowed up to

03:07:24.046 --> 03:07:28.110
3 minutes. If you wish to speak during public hearing portion,

03:07:28.624 --> 03:07:31.916
please complete a comment form located

03:07:32.416 --> 03:07:34.776
in the back and return it to the city recorder. So it's on the little

03:07:34.808 --> 03:07:38.068
table back there, and our city recorder's up here. Um,

03:07:38.261 --> 03:07:41.875
council members will listen but not engage in discussion during public comment.

03:07:42.277 --> 03:07:46.132
Disruptive behavior, personal attacks, or comments

03:07:46.632 --> 03:07:49.951
about individual city employees are not permitted. If you have issues

03:07:50.144 --> 03:07:53.669
or questions regarding staff or personnel, Deputy City Manager

03:07:54.169 --> 03:07:56.506
Steve Mumford will meet you in the foyer for further discussion.

03:07:57.115 --> 03:08:01.121
Lastly, public comment period is for items not associated

03:08:01.621 --> 03:08:05.175
with a scheduled public hearing. If your comment relates to a public hearing

03:08:05.287 --> 03:08:09.197
item, please wait until that item is called. And I had

03:08:09.697 --> 03:08:13.348
already announced that 16A and 17A do not have

03:08:13.620 --> 03:08:16.924
public hearings. But 15A, which is an ordinance

03:08:17.424 --> 03:08:21.075
of Eagle Mountain City amending Eagle Mountain Municipal Code, uh,

03:08:21.124 --> 03:08:23.368
16.20 for preliminary plots,

03:08:23.384 --> 03:08:27.482
16.25 for final plots, and 17 site

03:08:27.498 --> 03:08:30.935
plan review regarding application requirements and cost estimates.

03:08:31.306 --> 03:08:33.727
So, if you'd like to speak on that one, we ask that you'd wait until

03:08:34.227 --> 03:08:37.488
that public hearing takes place. Now, I will open

03:08:37.504 --> 03:08:41.450
the public comment period at 7:08. And invite anyone.

03:08:42.030 --> 03:08:44.270
Lacey, do you have some for us?

03:08:45.091 --> 03:08:46.493
Awesome. Please come up, sir.

03:08:48.880 --> 03:08:51.243
Did you say George? Yeah. Yep. Come on up. Thank you.

03:08:54.121 --> 03:08:57.256
Please state your name in the microphone. My name is George Reed. I live on

03:08:57.756 --> 03:09:00.760
1148 East Ira Hodgins, Janick Parkway.

03:09:01.696 --> 03:09:04.860
We have a very, very serious problem about speeding.

03:09:05.786 --> 03:09:08.977
On that road. I've spoke to the mayor at

03:09:09.090 --> 03:09:12.794
a friend's wedding. Uh, that was what, 2 months

03:09:13.294 --> 03:09:15.424
ago? Nothing is being done.

03:09:16.610 --> 03:09:20.058
Uh, I talked to Mr. Salazar because he's

03:09:20.558 --> 03:09:24.452
the assistant engineer. He said that they're going to do a city

03:09:24.484 --> 03:09:29.119
study for speeding. We have had 4 studies done on

03:09:29.619 --> 03:09:33.257
Ira Hodges already. We've had the wires put across that road 4 times. Uh,

03:09:34.172 --> 03:09:37.576
I talked to Sergeant Gilstrap. I— he actually invited me to do

03:09:38.076 --> 03:09:41.510
a ride-along with him, and, uh, he had let me know

03:09:41.639 --> 03:09:45.171
that, uh, on the one study that they did, that there

03:09:45.671 --> 03:09:49.330
was at least 6 instances of people going 60 miles an

03:09:49.442 --> 03:09:52.220
hour on a 25-mile-an-hour road.

03:09:53.039 --> 03:09:56.909
I literally had, uh, 2 young men coming off of, uh,

03:09:59.057 --> 03:10:02.695
the street next to us. They were coming around the corner. We heard

03:10:03.195 --> 03:10:06.829
a bang. He skidded clear around the corner, hit my driveway,

03:10:06.925 --> 03:10:10.482
and skidded halfway up my driveway, busted a wheel

03:10:10.594 --> 03:10:13.815
and knocked off 2 tires. Being the guy that I am,

03:10:13.879 --> 03:10:16.619
I fixed his car for him. I told him to leave it there and I

03:10:16.683 --> 03:10:20.112
would fix it for him. So, I try to do everything

03:10:20.144 --> 03:10:23.733
I can to make things right. We do have petitions signed

03:10:24.233 --> 03:10:27.633
here. We have 50 names. On this, they've talked about

03:10:27.761 --> 03:10:31.423
putting us like a speed table. We need a speed

03:10:31.455 --> 03:10:33.575
bump, a speed dip,

03:10:34.443 --> 03:10:37.237
something to slow everybody down. It's just,

03:10:37.880 --> 03:10:41.317
it's out of control. Thank you for bringing it

03:10:41.817 --> 03:10:44.305
to our attention. We'll invite you to give the petition to our city recorder.

03:10:44.449 --> 03:10:48.159
Ira Hodges was never meant to be a thoroughfare. We know they put

03:10:48.659 --> 03:10:52.387
those 2 residential areas to the West of us.

03:10:52.661 --> 03:10:55.368
Okay. And so everybody has to come down that road.

03:10:56.190 --> 03:10:59.896
I would make a recommendation. It gets

03:11:00.396 --> 03:11:04.391
extremely bad as soon as school starts. That's going to be starting here in

03:11:04.891 --> 03:11:08.581
August. We would petition that something be done

03:11:09.258 --> 03:11:12.160
prior to the start of school. Okay. Okay.

03:11:12.644 --> 03:11:15.307
Thank you. Yes, please.

03:11:15.604 --> 03:11:18.435
Thank you. Thank you for sharing your concern with us.

03:11:19.036 --> 03:11:28.563
All right, Lacy, who else do we have? Shelly Anderson. Shelly Anderson.

03:11:28.676 --> 03:11:32.460
Uh, Shelly Anderson, 1176 Ira Hodges. Thank you. Um, we moved

03:11:32.960 --> 03:11:36.347
into our neighborhood almost 19 years ago. We've lived in Eagle Mountain for

03:11:36.847 --> 03:11:38.156
29 years.

03:11:40.596 --> 03:11:43.565
We've been here a long time. We moved out here with the hopes of living

03:11:43.614 --> 03:11:47.421
in a small town, which we did for a long time. Moved into

03:11:47.453 --> 03:11:50.166
a bigger home because that's what we wanted for our family. We moved into an

03:11:50.198 --> 03:11:53.426
equestrian neighborhood because we own horses and we love that.

03:11:54.373 --> 03:11:57.087
The equestrian neighborhood that we moved into is supposed to have a golf course behind

03:11:57.587 --> 03:12:00.844
it, which was going to be really cool. Fast forward today, we're getting high-density housing,

03:12:00.956 --> 03:12:04.585
I believe, behind us. And there's no sidewalks, and our neighborhood

03:12:04.633 --> 03:12:07.845
doesn't want sidewalks. Planning Commission, I think,

03:12:07.861 --> 03:12:11.876
kind of messed up. The road should be a lot wider. Especially for

03:12:12.376 --> 03:12:15.584
all the traffic that has to go through there to get to the elementary,

03:12:15.940 --> 03:12:18.595
which we fought when that happened because it wasn't a good thoroughway,

03:12:19.578 --> 03:12:23.427
and we lost that battle then. I thank

03:12:23.927 --> 03:12:26.303
you for everything you do. I don't want you to think that it goes unnoticed

03:12:26.803 --> 03:12:29.897
and it goes unappreciated. You guys do a lot, and I appreciate it.

03:12:30.144 --> 03:12:31.989
I'm gonna ditto everything George said.

03:12:34.275 --> 03:12:37.735
I about got hit by a car last night, by a motorcycle. As I stood

03:12:38.235 --> 03:12:40.749
in the middle of the road and went like this, slow the heck down.

03:12:41.615 --> 03:12:44.742
He continued to come straight at me and then swerve around me. We've had

03:12:45.242 --> 03:12:48.030
cars swerve into the gravel pits off the road in front of our house.

03:12:48.928 --> 03:12:52.375
We had our mailbox plowed over by a minivan a

03:12:52.760 --> 03:12:55.551
couple of years ago. We've had a gun pulled on a neighbor because he was

03:12:55.583 --> 03:12:58.678
mad at the guy speeding, and the guy pulled a gun on him. We've had

03:12:58.710 --> 03:13:01.580
3 kids hit in our neighborhood. It's enough.

03:13:02.719 --> 03:13:06.219
The minute someone gets killed, Or wounded greatly,

03:13:06.428 --> 03:13:09.513
it's going to be a huge problem, and I want to save that from happening.

03:13:10.187 --> 03:13:12.967
Our horse happens to live across the street from us. I have 10 grandkids.

03:13:13.802 --> 03:13:16.261
First thing they do when they come over is want to go feed the horse.

03:13:17.016 --> 03:13:20.310
I've had cars swerve at my grandkids. I've had them

03:13:20.810 --> 03:13:23.700
speed as we walked the Arctic Circle to get ice cream cones. I watched a

03:13:23.748 --> 03:13:27.009
little kid wreck on his car, and cars pull over

03:13:27.058 --> 03:13:30.271
and honk at a little 5-year-old to get up and get out of their way.

03:13:30.737 --> 03:13:33.965
In a crosswalk. It's enough.

03:13:34.527 --> 03:13:37.819
We've complained to the sheriff department multiple times. We have yelled

03:13:38.319 --> 03:13:41.850
and screamed at neighbors. I'm sure half my neighborhood hates me. I don't care if

03:13:42.350 --> 03:13:44.740
I can save one life. If I can save one limb, it is worth it.

03:13:44.869 --> 03:13:48.322
It is time to act. I talked to Jared Norton. I'm sure

03:13:48.822 --> 03:13:51.405
you all know who he is. He's on Unified Fire. He said enough is enough.

03:13:52.770 --> 03:13:55.725
Speed bumps have to happen. Stop signs. I don't care if you put a stop

03:13:56.225 --> 03:13:59.627
sign on every 3-way in that neighborhood. People are fed up. Um,

03:13:59.964 --> 03:14:03.144
it'd be nice to say everyone would be nice. If everyone could just

03:14:03.176 --> 03:14:06.162
be nice and slow down, it'd be great. That's not what's happening. It's getting worse

03:14:06.662 --> 03:14:09.454
and worse the more people that live there. So we would appreciate if you'd do

03:14:09.954 --> 03:14:13.356
something for it— about it. Thank you, Shelley. Thank you. Thank you. All right,

03:14:13.388 --> 03:14:16.743
anyone else? Okay, so that's it for

03:14:17.065 --> 03:14:20.356
the forms that we have filled out. Is there anyone else in the

03:14:20.856 --> 03:14:23.919
audience that would like to come up and share their thoughts? Go ahead.

03:14:24.384 --> 03:14:27.590
If you could fill out a form after you're done and make sure our recorder

03:14:28.090 --> 03:14:30.731
gets it, that would be great. Just start by stating your name in the microphone,

03:14:30.780 --> 03:14:34.370
please. I'm Justin Hopkinson. I live on 872

03:14:34.402 --> 03:14:37.608
East Waddell Street, just over from where they

03:14:38.108 --> 03:14:41.631
live. And, and so I got the other entrance to Mountain Trails Elementary.

03:14:41.679 --> 03:14:44.404
And yeah, when school starts, it's, it's horrible.

03:14:45.045 --> 03:14:47.706
And I adopted a little boy from a cousin's heroin addict,

03:14:48.267 --> 03:14:51.558
so he's 6 years old now, has severe ADHD. I have to

03:14:52.058 --> 03:14:55.382
keep a death grip on him. Otherwise, he'll run out in the road. And he's—

03:14:56.463 --> 03:15:00.077
there's some cars, new people that moved in, that these kids that are racing

03:15:00.109 --> 03:15:03.352
up and down the street, contractors that I've yelled at hundreds

03:15:03.852 --> 03:15:07.244
of times. And I walked out in front of one guy hauling a big load

03:15:07.744 --> 03:15:10.935
of material, and he

03:15:11.435 --> 03:15:13.593
yelled at me. He says, you think I could stop? I'm like, exactly. Look at

03:15:14.093 --> 03:15:15.541
this little boy. If he runs out in front of you, you're going to be

03:15:16.041 --> 03:15:18.710
able to stop for him? Yeah. And it's, it's out of control over there.

03:15:18.936 --> 03:15:22.977
And I've called numerous times the police to help

03:15:23.477 --> 03:15:26.634
us out. And it's, it's, yeah, it's out of control. And I'm scared

03:15:27.134 --> 03:15:30.074
for my little boy and all the other neighbor kids. And yeah,

03:15:30.411 --> 03:15:33.963
definitely during the school time that people are going out

03:15:34.463 --> 03:15:37.427
of— the parents are out of control. They'll go into oncoming traffic to,

03:15:38.142 --> 03:15:40.837
to go around the people, the long line to pull in there. It's,

03:15:41.730 --> 03:15:45.437
it's That's horrific. Thank you. All right. Thank you. Thank you.

03:15:46.290 --> 03:15:48.785
All right. Anyone else would like to give public comment?

03:15:51.450 --> 03:15:54.201
All right, we'll close public comment at 7:15.

03:15:54.703 --> 03:15:57.001
And as we do that, I think it's important just to,

03:15:57.940 --> 03:16:01.895
um, set the expectation for our city manager that

03:16:02.009 --> 03:16:05.712
I think council would like a report back at our next meeting of

03:16:05.744 --> 03:16:09.629
how we're going to address Ira Hodges and Just give us kind of

03:16:10.129 --> 03:16:13.650
a return and report on that, because we can tell that it's a

03:16:13.698 --> 03:16:17.303
significant problem. So, thank you. Happy to do so. Sure.

03:16:18.104 --> 03:16:21.244
I'm— I ask the mayor pro tem if I could speak to this for just

03:16:21.744 --> 03:16:24.000
a minute. I want you to know that this has been a concern of ours.

03:16:24.977 --> 03:16:28.758
Um, we've, we've tried fairly diligently to find some

03:16:29.258 --> 03:16:32.555
resolution to several places in the city, and Ira Hodges is one of them.

03:16:33.404 --> 03:16:36.817
In this budget cycle, this past budget cycle, we actually funded

03:16:36.929 --> 03:16:40.967
$200,000 worth of speed tables. And one of the areas very specifically that

03:16:41.467 --> 03:16:44.845
we targeted is Ira Hodges. Uh, I want you to know that, that we've set

03:16:45.345 --> 03:16:48.548
money aside for that to happen. We are waiting for our staff to finish up

03:16:49.048 --> 03:16:52.378
a report, which we should have in the next week or 2. That's the anticipation,

03:16:52.394 --> 03:16:56.097
to make sure that, that the traffic tables that we think are the best solution,

03:16:56.481 --> 03:17:00.103
that our engineering team agrees with us. If there's something different that they recommend,

03:17:00.151 --> 03:17:03.277
we'll certainly keep you in the loop. Um, but we're very aware of that,

03:17:03.373 --> 03:17:07.107
and you're not alone in that concern. There are several other areas that

03:17:07.607 --> 03:17:09.912
are adjacent to elementary schools that are really awful in the city,

03:17:10.586 --> 03:17:13.632
and we're concerned about it citywide. We're not going to take comments, or we're

03:17:14.132 --> 03:17:17.463
just going to— I just want to give you an update. Um, but I want

03:17:17.963 --> 03:17:19.884
you to know that we're very aware of it and that we're as concerned about

03:17:20.384 --> 03:17:23.298
it as you are. I've been to your home. I've seen that. I've watched it.

03:17:23.347 --> 03:17:26.777
So, um, and I think that, that our staff

03:17:27.277 --> 03:17:31.298
is really great at listening to us and understanding, but what they don't often get

03:17:31.410 --> 03:17:35.963
the chance to do is to come sit and meet with the residents and

03:17:36.463 --> 03:17:36.480
And to hear those concerns that you just shared. So thank you for sharing your

03:17:36.980 --> 03:17:39.948
thoughts, Shelley, and, and, and, and the rest of you. Um,

03:17:40.558 --> 03:17:43.705
anyway, I just want— I wanted you to know that we're very cognizant of it,

03:17:43.786 --> 03:17:46.740
that we are making some forward progress for the first time in the 5 years

03:17:47.240 --> 03:17:50.818
I've been here, 4 and a half years I've been here. We've actually allocated resources

03:17:50.931 --> 03:17:54.046
and we're making— we're making some adjustments. Thank you,

03:17:54.062 --> 03:17:57.097
Councilmember Wright. All right, now time has been

03:17:57.177 --> 03:18:00.760
set aside for City Council and Mayor to make comments. Let's go ahead and start

03:18:01.260 --> 03:18:01.904
with Councilmember Huish.

03:18:05.410 --> 03:18:07.531
Thank you, Pro Tem Mayor Clark.

03:18:08.656 --> 03:18:12.482
Government just never moves fast enough. That's the one thing I've learned

03:18:12.610 --> 03:18:15.670
sitting here and being on that side, that there,

03:18:15.961 --> 03:18:19.093
there's clearly a need all throughout our city. And I just echo what

03:18:19.206 --> 03:18:23.034
Councilmember Wright has said. If I could show up tomorrow

03:18:23.534 --> 03:18:26.189
with a speed table, I'd probably just put it in. Um, but we want to

03:18:26.689 --> 03:18:30.548
make sure that the engineering is right, that we're allocating resources in the highest

03:18:31.381 --> 03:18:35.451
problem areas, and, and your concerns are valid and

03:18:35.467 --> 03:18:39.217
are heard. Appreciate all that our staff

03:18:39.717 --> 03:18:43.800
do. I'm amazed at all the different projects we have going on. It's a

03:18:43.880 --> 03:18:47.310
pretty vast machine that's being built in Eagle Mountain, and we have a

03:18:47.810 --> 03:18:50.915
lot of infrastructure projects going in. We've got water being built.

03:18:50.980 --> 03:18:54.522
sewers being built, lots of infrastructure, and I'm just grateful.

03:18:55.440 --> 03:18:58.467
It's amazing that how a city works and functions,

03:18:58.499 --> 03:19:02.214
and I appreciate all that you do and, um, look forward to

03:19:02.714 --> 03:19:05.099
tonight's comments and agenda items.

03:19:06.897 --> 03:19:08.874
Thank you, Council Member Huish. Council Member Wood?

03:19:11.941 --> 03:19:15.780
I'm probably not going to be as warm and fuzzy as Zach was. Hearing you

03:19:15.797 --> 03:19:19.965
guys say that just makes me more mad. About our

03:19:20.162 --> 03:19:22.111
inaction, frankly.

03:19:24.712 --> 03:19:28.295
I mean, I when it happens,

03:19:28.969 --> 03:19:32.520
everybody's going to go, "Oh my gosh! Let's hurry and try to fix the problem."

03:19:32.585 --> 03:19:35.713
And I just I do not make the excuse

03:19:36.213 --> 03:19:39.112
that government can't go fast enough. That is a lie. I'm sorry; it is a

03:19:39.612 --> 03:19:42.786
lie. We can. We have the resources to do it. It is

03:19:43.286 --> 03:19:47.166
our Unwillingness to do things that are out of character of what everybody thinks

03:19:47.666 --> 03:19:51.649
we should do. And I, I'm upset. The same problem exists

03:19:52.149 --> 03:19:55.126
in 3 or 4 other neighborhoods where elementary schools are.

03:19:55.610 --> 03:19:59.061
It's unacceptable, and I am sorry that we have not

03:19:59.561 --> 03:20:02.978
acted. It's inexcusable, and I can promise

03:20:03.478 --> 03:20:06.039
you that those who are dragging their feet, if it was in front of their

03:20:06.539 --> 03:20:07.254
house, it would already be built.

03:20:12.155 --> 03:20:15.657
All right, Councilmember Whiting. So I heard

03:20:15.914 --> 03:20:19.062
multiple times we've worked with the sheriff's office on this, that, and the other.

03:20:19.705 --> 03:20:22.580
You're all just giving the reasons for a tax increase.

03:20:23.142 --> 03:20:26.628
We need more public safety officers, and it's pretty evident.

03:20:27.174 --> 03:20:29.696
I think the ones we have are doing a great job. We just need more

03:20:29.744 --> 03:20:32.892
of them because we've grown a lot as a city, and they cost money for

03:20:33.392 --> 03:20:37.175
them to come in. And so, You know, the tax increase is

03:20:37.191 --> 03:20:39.307
going to be discussed here soon and voted on.

03:20:40.317 --> 03:20:42.689
And one thing that I'm looking forward to with these additional,

03:20:43.859 --> 03:20:47.466
you know, public safety officers is we may be able to get more

03:20:47.966 --> 03:20:51.537
patrol happening in neighborhoods, especially to help with speeding and things like that. And I

03:20:51.697 --> 03:20:54.679
can't speak to prior, you know, prior studies that were done. All I can speak

03:20:55.179 --> 03:20:57.388
is the studies happening now, and I can speak to the resolve of the council

03:20:57.888 --> 03:21:01.331
that sits up before you to solve these problems, and it's going to

03:21:01.831 --> 03:21:04.414
happen. So you, you can feel the energy that's coming right here. It's, it's going

03:21:04.914 --> 03:21:07.673
to happen. We'll bring solutions and as fast as we can. So,

03:21:08.380 --> 03:21:11.752
um, anyway, we're grateful for the public comes out and gives us insights

03:21:12.252 --> 03:21:15.637
and comments because we need your eyes and, uh, need you, need you with us,

03:21:15.846 --> 03:21:18.929
um, to give us, help us, help us make better decisions.

03:21:19.539 --> 03:21:23.425
Uh, one last thing I'll mention, uh, be on the lookout for a

03:21:23.925 --> 03:21:26.829
new half marathon that will be here in Cedar Valley.

03:21:27.823 --> 03:21:31.385
We are in the works to make this happen on October

03:21:31.433 --> 03:21:35.186
3rd. More information is going to be coming out. It will be the

03:21:35.267 --> 03:21:38.812
I Believe in You Run Cedar Valley, and it's

03:21:39.312 --> 03:21:42.309
going to be in partnership with Ben Lyon. And we'll be carrying signs,

03:21:42.421 --> 03:21:44.458
and we're going to have a run here that is going to be epic.

03:21:44.586 --> 03:21:48.404
It's going to be a combined effort between Cedar Fort and

03:21:48.821 --> 03:21:52.318
Eagle Mountain City, who will be co-sponsoring. It's going

03:21:52.818 --> 03:21:56.330
to be pretty epic to bring our community together. And money from that is going

03:21:56.830 --> 03:22:00.538
to be going toward, uh, this volunteer fire department that

03:22:01.038 --> 03:22:04.453
Cedar Fort has, as well as our volunteer police services here as

03:22:04.631 --> 03:22:08.222
well. These are some of the things where people say, well, you know,

03:22:08.351 --> 03:22:11.408
we want you to, to manage differently so you don't have to raise taxes as

03:22:11.457 --> 03:22:15.085
much. Well, this is one of those efforts to bring in money from

03:22:15.149 --> 03:22:18.434
businesses and other people who are willing to— the running community— to

03:22:18.934 --> 03:22:21.558
where we can then have that money flow into some of our public safety as

03:22:22.058 --> 03:22:24.361
well. well. We are looking at other ways to do that, and in this case,

03:22:24.730 --> 03:22:27.619
it's going to help with those items I just mentioned and then also help with

03:22:27.763 --> 03:22:31.198
unity and, uh, mindset and mentality

03:22:31.390 --> 03:22:34.648
in this, in this valley. And I'm really excited about that. So more, more details

03:22:34.664 --> 03:22:38.532
will be coming out about that. Thank you, Council Member White. And Council Member Wright?

03:22:39.093 --> 03:22:41.966
Well, I took a minute, but I'll, I'll just add one thing that I'd like

03:22:42.466 --> 03:22:45.849
