03:22:48.481 --> 03:22:52.087
So if if you have these or willing to donate them to the, to the

03:22:52.587 --> 03:22:55.612
food pantry that's in our Eagle Mountain Library here just behind us. Flour,

03:22:55.676 --> 03:22:58.561
granulated sugar, vegetable oil, iodized salt,

03:22:59.202 --> 03:23:02.342
black pepper, onion powder, garlic powder, baking powder and soda,

03:23:02.423 --> 03:23:06.012
white vinegar. And also helpful in the pantry would

03:23:06.512 --> 03:23:09.922
be peanut butter, canned tuna or meat, canned milk, canned vegetables,

03:23:09.954 --> 03:23:13.784
canned soups, packaged pasta, oatmeal, hot cereal,

03:23:13.800 --> 03:23:16.733
white or brown rice. I just think it's important to remember that there are those

03:23:16.749 --> 03:23:20.355
in our community that have food insecurities, and anything we can do, those of us

03:23:20.855 --> 03:23:24.138
that perhaps have a little bit that we can donate,

03:23:24.603 --> 03:23:27.071
those are the types of items that they're looking for this month. I wanted to

03:23:27.103 --> 03:23:30.950
make that announcement. Thank you. Thank you. And I just

03:23:31.450 --> 03:23:34.124
