03:23:34.156 --> 03:23:37.971
out and sharing some of those very personal concerns and experiences.

03:23:38.708 --> 03:23:42.218
Um, we do need to do better, and I think we're working

03:23:42.250 --> 03:23:45.848
toward that. Um, and I'm grateful that

03:23:46.348 --> 03:23:50.203
no one's been hurt in the way that

03:23:50.703 --> 03:23:54.107
we've talked about. I appreciate you talking about life and limb, and sometimes

03:23:54.139 --> 03:23:57.482
neighbors get mad because you have to stand up for what's important.

03:23:57.530 --> 03:24:00.888
So thank you for coming out for that. And I thank all of my fellow

03:24:01.388 --> 03:24:05.355
council members for the things that they've shared. Um, we have some cool things

03:24:05.388 --> 03:24:08.408
going on in our community right now, and, um,

03:24:09.227 --> 03:24:13.172
We have a really cool communications department that's

03:24:13.672 --> 03:24:16.106
