03:24:16.604 --> 03:24:20.051
One thing that our community services board has been working on

03:24:20.067 --> 03:24:23.900
is a bingo card, and it's a bingo card that goes from,

03:24:24.301 --> 03:24:27.877
like, Pony Express Days all the way to basically the end of the year.

03:24:28.551 --> 03:24:32.143
And there's prizes and different things that different people are going to be donating

03:24:32.640 --> 03:24:36.410
for people who complete their bingo card. But. If you missed

03:24:36.910 --> 03:24:39.894
one of the items on the bingo card, there's a QR code on there with

03:24:40.394 --> 03:24:43.780
some like makeup items, and we encourage you— it's a really fun way to

03:24:43.812 --> 03:24:46.670
celebrate our 30th anniversary as a city,

03:24:47.248 --> 03:24:51.680
um, and to participate in that. Um, and that's

03:24:51.744 --> 03:24:55.228
all I have to say. Um, I will entertain a

03:24:55.728 --> 03:24:59.660
motion for the consent agenda making the minor adjustments

03:24:59.708 --> 03:25:02.580
