03:25:03.988 --> 03:25:06.203
Yeah, Mayor Pro Tem, I, I move to, uh,

03:25:06.494 --> 03:25:08.937
approve the consent agenda with the,

03:25:09.632 --> 03:25:12.885
uh, spelling corrections to the minutes as noted in the work session. Second.

03:25:13.936 --> 03:25:17.804
All right, we have a motion from Council Member Whiting and a second

03:25:17.820 --> 03:25:21.130
from Council Member Wright. Um, we'll begin the vote

03:25:21.630 --> 03:25:24.460
with me. Yes. Yes. Yes.

03:25:25.191 --> 03:25:27.450
Yes. Yes, thank you.

