03:31:46.865 --> 03:31:49.628
I think we're okay. Okay.

03:31:49.887 --> 03:31:53.433
Okay, seeing none else, we'll go ahead and begin the

03:31:53.933 --> 03:31:56.833
vote. Councilmember Whiting? Yes. Councilmember Wood? Yes.

03:31:57.141 --> 03:32:00.351
Councilmember Huish? Yes. Councilmember Wright? Yes.

03:32:00.932 --> 03:32:04.367
