03:32:24.106 --> 03:32:27.131
of Eagle Mountain City, Utah, amending the Eagle Mountain Municipal Code Section 16.20,

03:32:28.520 --> 03:32:32.185
preliminary plats, 16.25, final plats,

03:32:32.201 --> 03:32:36.016
and 17.100, Site plan review regarding

03:32:36.129 --> 03:32:38.549
application requirements and cost estimates,

03:32:39.098 --> 03:32:42.825
and Brandon Larson has

03:32:42.890 --> 03:32:45.560
a presentation for this. Thank you.

03:32:48.356 --> 03:32:52.278
This is, as I noted in the earlier meeting,

03:32:52.680 --> 03:32:57.068
this is part of our effort to clean up our application process,

03:32:57.294 --> 03:33:01.057
particularly the front end of our application

03:33:01.090 --> 03:33:04.685
process. And as you noted, it's for preliminary

03:33:04.717 --> 03:33:07.797
