03:33:07.910 --> 03:33:11.579
that we've typically required

03:33:12.050 --> 03:33:15.281
a cost estimate towards the latter end of the

03:33:15.781 --> 03:33:19.729
approval process, and actually

03:33:19.826 --> 03:33:23.949
after the approval process, and it ends up creating a situation

03:33:24.048 --> 03:33:27.952
where when we're going to generate bond

03:33:28.452 --> 03:33:31.976
