03:34:23.798 --> 03:34:26.963
to give it to us earlier, um, so we can

03:34:28.457 --> 03:34:32.136
really facilitate a, a little bit smoother development process for them.

03:34:32.329 --> 03:34:36.132
So if you have any questions, I'm here to answer. Thank you, Brandon. Does council

03:34:36.632 --> 03:34:39.893
